  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude in the shipped content carries tuningStatus untuned and the balance harness owns all of them -- so this file is a measurement and not a balance claim.",
    "The universe is still degenerate in the following ways, and this sweep closes none of them. Nothing in packages/scenario opens a portal, so no raid runs and no summon is ever created; portal-rush is therefore measured on what it does instead of raiding. Scribing stops when the materials stock empties. knowledgeKind has no consumer in the rules path.",
    "Not yet wired into npm run verify or .github/workflows/ci.yml. Adding it needs one script in package.json and one step per full-suite job in the workflow, and both files are frozen to this branch pending PR #42. The sweep and this baseline are committed so that the wiring is a two-line change somebody can make without re-running anything."
